Site
====

A personal website.

Requirements
------------

- md2html(1)

Installation
------------

The default ROOT, i.e. the installation directory, is "/srv/http".

	$ make
	# make [ROOT=rootdir] install

Structure
---------

The <assets> directory is copied to ROOT as is.

The <src> directory contains each page's Markdown file.

The <template> directory contains files that are used to generate the full HTML
document of each page.
